{"4368810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "8:00 AM : Still Morning", "steam_appid": 4368810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>8:00 AM – Still Morning</i></strong> is a short narrative exploration game that follows an ordinary morning slowly drifting out of balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make breakfast. Walk through familiar rooms. Interact with everyday objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere between these small actions, something feels slightly out of place — and you begin to understand why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>At 8:00 AM, the house wakes up before the family does.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>And not everyone is ready to wake up.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📋Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📚A short narrative experience set in a single morning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩Environmental puzzles based on everyday objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿Focused on daily life and emotional storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚠️No horror elements or jumpscares.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌐Language</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >日本語 ( Japenese )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >한국어 ( Korean )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >简体中文 ( Simplified Chinese  )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >繁體中文 ( Traditional Chinese )</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>This is a game about mornings that keep happening —</i></strong><br><stron